cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the reported results, please cite it as below."
title: "MISP-QEKS Multimodal Open-Vocabulary Keyword Spotting"
abstract: >-
  Query-by-Example keyword spotting for open-vocabulary keywords on the
  MISP-QEKS dataset. The system combines whisper-tiny embeddings, a supervised
  p4 matcher, unsupervised multi-template matching, split-aware fusion and
  outset DTW weighting, reaching 0.90042 AUC in the 2026 iFLYTEK competition.
authors:
  - name: "MILK Team"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Alwayshere-su/misp-qeks-multimodal-kws"
url: "https://github.com/Alwayshere-su/misp-qeks-multimodal-kws"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-20
keywords:
  - keyword spotting
  - query-by-example
  - open vocabulary
  - multimodal
  - whisper
  - pytorch
